#### How to compare
Method: SetCoverage
- Guard: Holding a workplace pension is passive experience; a report distinguishing it from self-directed investing is being accurate, not inconsistent.
- Guard: Plans held do not prove understanding — do not treat plan ownership as evidence of knowledge.
